     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Program')
     A            ECTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Time')
     A            ECDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint' 'Date')
      *
     A            ECIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Init' 'User')
